Package: gsel
Type: Package
Title: Selection and Breeding Programme Design
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Soerensen", email = "peter.sorensen@r-qgg.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Establishes package foundations and proposed scientific contracts
    for selection policies and breeding programme design.
    Includes package documentation and a small reference calculation for
    teaching. This initial development package exports no scientific functions.
